   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: levelTopology(t, key) cuts out one level",
   "originalText": "How it works: levelTopology(t, key) cuts out one level",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each level has its own adjacencies, its own SPF and its own FRR, so LFA Lab shows one level at a time.\nIn YAML: a router’s level: 1 | 2 | 1-2 (left out = 1-2) and area; a link’s or LAN’s level: 1 | 2 (left\nout = both).",
   "originalText": "Each level has its own adjacencies, its own SPF and its own FRR, so LFA Lab shows one level at a time.\nIn YAML: a router’s level: 1 | 2 | 1-2 (left out = 1-2) and area; a link’s or LAN’s level: 1 | 2 (left\nout = both).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 240,
   "width": 783,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level-2 (key 2):        routers not level: 1;  links between them not level: 1;\n                        LANs not level: 1, with their L2-capable members\nLevel-1, area A (1:A):  L1-capable routers of area A;  links between them not level: 2.\n                        L1 adjacencies form only inside one area: links to another\n                        area are left out. A LAN keeps its members in A.\nAny level:              a LAN left with fewer than 2 members is dropped",
   "originalText": "Level-2 (key 2):        routers not level: 1;  links between them not level: 1;\n                        LANs not level: 1, with their L2-capable members\nLevel-1, area A (1:A):  L1-capable routers of area A;  links between them not level: 2.\n                        L1 adjacencies form only inside one area: links to another\n                        area are left out. A LAN keeps its members in A.\nAny level:              a LAN left with fewer than 2 members is dropped",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 363,
   "width": 288,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 10, the three views",
   "originalText": "Example 10, the three views",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 397,
   "width": 801,
   "height": 94,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "View                     Routers      Links                        LAN1\n-----------------------  -----------  ---------------------------  ----------------------\nLevel-2                  R2, R3, R4   R2–R3, R3–R4                 R2, R3, R4\nLevel-1, area 49.0001    R1, R2, R3   R1–R2, R1–R3, R2–R3          R2, R3\nLevel-1, area 49.0002    R4, R5       R4–R5                        only R4 → dropped",
   "originalText": "View                     Routers      Links                        LAN1\n-----------------------  -----------  ---------------------------  ----------------------\nLevel-2                  R2, R3, R4   R2–R3, R3–R4                 R2, R3, R4\nLevel-1, area 49.0001    R1, R2, R3   R1–R2, R1–R3, R2–R3          R2, R3\nLevel-1, area 49.0002    R4, R5       R4–R5                        only R4 → dropped",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 501,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Picking a view makes it the network on screen: results, failures, coverage, heat map, what-if, weakest\nspots and quiz all work on it unchanged. \"Whole network, as one level\" puts every adjacency into one\nSPF.",
   "originalText": "Picking a view makes it the network on screen: results, failures, coverage, heat map, what-if, weakest\nspots and quiz all work on it unchanged. \"Whole network, as one level\" puts every adjacency into one\nSPF.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a22-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 575,
   "width": 681,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level-2, R2 → R4 over LAN1: the same LFA as in A21, R3 over R2–R3 (cost 25).",
   "originalText": "Level-2, R2 → R4 over LAN1: the same LFA as in A21, R3 over R2–R3 (cost 25).",
