  {
   "id": "a22-text-55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 810,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 435545,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5760095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Routes between levels: an L1 router’s default\n   route to the nearest L1/L2 router (ATT bit),\n   route leaking. Other areas’ destinations don’t\n   appear in a Level-1 view.\n•  LFA for inter-area prefixes (RFC 5286 §6.2).\n•  Per-level metrics on one link: import them as two\n   links, level: 1 and level: 2.",
   "originalText": "•  Routes between levels: an L1 router’s default\n   route to the nearest L1/L2 router (ATT bit),\n   route leaking. Other areas’ destinations don’t\n   appear in a Level-1 view.\n•  LFA for inter-area prefixes (RFC 5286 §6.2).\n•  Per-level metrics on one link: import them as two\n   links, level: 1 and level: 2.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
